# The stop guard's own state, which is per-session runtime bookkeeping rather than
# configuration. It sits one level below `.workflow/current/` because wfctl reads every
# `*.json` at the top of that directory as a work binding and parsed this as a malformed
# one; a subdirectory is invisible to that scan.
.workflow/current/hooks/
